# 📖 Revision Cheat Sheet

| Concept         | Key Point                                                 |
| --------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |
| XSS             | Browser executes untrusted content due to unsafe handling |
| Stored XSS      | Malicious content saved on server                         |
| Reflected XSS   | Input reflected immediately in response                   |
| DOM XSS         | Happens in browser-side JavaScript                        |
| CSP             | Restricts allowed content sources                         |
| Output Encoding | Treats user input as text                                 |
| HttpOnly        | Helps protect cookies from JavaScript access              |
| Secure Cookie   | Sent only over HTTPS                                      |
| SameSite        | Helps reduce certain cross-site request risks             |

